<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore May Asian dollar assets up 14.6 pct - MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore May Asian dollar assets up 14.6 pct - MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  May 97   April 97   May 96</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		552.66     536.53   482.37</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    185.62     176.38   170.08</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    310.55     304.85   263.84</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 14.6 percent year-on-year in May.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
